{"overview":"داستان این سریال درباره شخصی به نام ” Red ” که یک خلاف‌کار بزرگ و حرفه‌ای است که زمان زیادی مامورین و پلیس و اف‌بی‌آی دنبای او بودند. اما روزی او تصمیم می‌گیرد خود را تحویل قانون بدهد. اما برای این کار شرایطی در نظر دارد. او می‌خواهد تنها با یک پلیس کار کند و با همکاری آن پلیس بقیه افراد خلاف‌کار و تبهکار معروف را دستگیری کند...","tagline":"هرگز به یک جنایتکار اعتماد نکنید... تا زمانی که مجبور شوید.","overview_en":"Raymond \"Red\" Reddington, one of the FBI's most wanted fugitives, surrenders in person at FBI Headquarters in Washington, D.C. He claims that he and the FBI have the same interests: bringing down dangerous criminals and terrorists. In the last two decades, he's made a list of criminals and terrorists that matter the most but the FBI cannot find because it does not know they exist. Reddington calls this \"The Blacklist\". Reddington will co-operate, but insists that he will speak only to Elizabeth Keen, a rookie FBI profiler.","tagline_en":"Never trust a criminal... Until you have to.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":11,"y":2013,"poster":"/jPT3J4xlQ3yF5fczAopLofHBGq3.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":22,"y":2013,"poster":"/c18fZsOjPKbYioz7PaCY5GQiwY4.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":22,"y":2014,"poster":"/4q6rIEn62nqxxgeuF9rDdDkUnl1.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":23,"y":2015,"poster":"/mivR9jhIye1XT4vdGL5pWC28cYz.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":22,"y":2016,"poster":"/d5AJOxPzGkAHiaCHcESVCim1vHu.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":22,"y":2017,"poster":"/rl3yjCHmTIFKOkHtBjtxw4H18K0.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":22,"y":2019,"poster":"/f1R6R8AVS8EwaOUltlVxNjASZAs.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":19,"y":2019,"poster":"/e72ZZsSeKADafuy2aPWCUp15GgE.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":22,"y":2020,"poster":"/htJzeRcYI2ewMm4PTrg98UMXShe.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":22,"y":2021,"poster":"/r935SMphvXppx5bJjbIBNx02fwc.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":22,"y":2023,"poster":"/o37EENvesJ8x1r70uhl0JPv8gQv.jpg"}],"e